Author: whycz <whyczz@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Nov 16 23:14:13 2026 -0500

    fix(followup.1): make run-folder validation trustworthy
    
    For humans: the cycle-1 grade false-failed adherence: run folder present because the validations transport could carry the existing handoff folder in prose the validator could not read. The transport now emits one canonical shell one-liner and the validator reads presence tolerantly, while a folder missing tape.log or notes.md still fails.
    
    For LLMs: folderLines accepts array or newline string; lineHasFile affirms presence (yes/present/contains) and vetoes on affirmed absence (=no/missing/not found). Brief prescribes the exact for-loop one-liner verbatim. Regression block feeds canonical, prose, string, empty, and missing-file variants. Renders synced.

